{"id":"73df8af25850d4b3","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-normal-form-theorem.md","title":"Normal Form Theorem","display":"df-normal-form-theorem — Normal Form Theorem","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-normal-form-theorem","aliases":["90-df-normal-form-theorem"],"display":"df-normal-form-theorem — Normal Form Theorem","depends_on":["[[90-df-t-predicate]]","[[90-df-primitive-recursive]]","[[90-df-recursive-function-class]]","[[90-df-min-operator-generalized]]","[[90-df-program-numbering]]","[[90-lem-program-numbering]]","[[90-df-kleene-normal-form]]","[[90-df-relation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-normal-form-theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-normal-form-theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-normal-form-theorem — Normal Form Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"48b1cea94ba27d41\" href=\"?note=48b1cea94ba27d41\" title=\"90-df-t-predicate\">90-df-t-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"abc082683aa1de80\" href=\"?note=abc082683aa1de80\" title=\"90-df-primitive-recursive\">90-df-primitive-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"137d75d038de4a47\" href=\"?note=137d75d038de4a47\" title=\"90-df-recursive-function-class\">90-df-recursive-function-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"523fadf1703582fe\" href=\"?note=523fadf1703582fe\" title=\"90-df-min-operator-generalized\">90-df-min-operator-generalized</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" href=\"?note=5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" title=\"90-df-program-numbering\">90-df-program-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"42029390ebbb59c5\" href=\"?note=42029390ebbb59c5\" title=\"90-lem-program-numbering\">90-lem-program-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"19a3e9309cfd35f0\" href=\"?note=19a3e9309cfd35f0\" title=\"90-df-kleene-normal-form\">90-df-kleene-normal-form</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"4badec96813b3395\" href=\"?note=4badec96813b3395\" title=\"90-df-relation\">90-df-relation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-normal-form-theorem-—-Normal-Form-Theorem-(Kleene)\">df-normal-form-theorem — Normal Form Theorem (Kleene)</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；函数类与谓词类见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"137d75d038de4a47\" href=\"?note=137d75d038de4a47\" title=\"90-df-recursive-function-class\">90-df-recursive-function-class</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"abc082683aa1de80\" href=\"?note=abc082683aa1de80\" title=\"90-df-primitive-recursive\">90-df-primitive-recursive</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"523fadf1703582fe\" href=\"?note=523fadf1703582fe\" title=\"90-df-min-operator-generalized\">90-df-min-operator-generalized</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\simeq\">\\(\\simeq\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" href=\"?note=5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" title=\"90-df-program-numbering\">90-df-program-numbering</a> 所引用的部分函数外延相等，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\circ\">\\(\\circ\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"4badec96813b3395\" href=\"?note=4badec96813b3395\" title=\"90-df-relation\">90-df-relation</a> 的关系图复合。集合推导式中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\frown\">\\(\\frown\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle y\\rangle\">\\(\\langle y\\rangle\\)</span> 为集合论有限列连接和一元列，不是自然数序列码。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PRPred}\">\\(\\mathrm{PRPred}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"abc082683aa1de80\" href=\"?note=abc082683aa1de80\" title=\"90-df-primitive-recursive\">90-df-primitive-recursive</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartRec}\">\\(\\mathrm{PartRec}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"137d75d038de4a47\" href=\"?note=137d75d038de4a47\" title=\"90-df-recursive-function-class\">90-df-recursive-function-class</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists T\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}_{k+2}\\ \\exists U\\in\\mathrm{PR}_1\\quad\n\\forall f:\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\\quad\n\\left[f\\in\\mathrm{PartRec}_k\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\nf\\simeq U\\circ\\left(\\mu\\left\\{\n\\vec x{}^\\frown\\langle y\\rangle:\n\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\land y\\in\\mathbb N\\land T(e,\\vec x,y)\n\\right\\}\\right)\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists T\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}_{k+2}\\ \\exists U\\in\\mathrm{PR}_1\\quad\n\\forall f:\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\\quad\n\\left[f\\in\\mathrm{PartRec}_k\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\nf\\simeq U\\circ\\left(\\mu\\left\\{\n\\vec x{}^\\frown\\langle y\\rangle:\n\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\land y\\in\\mathbb N\\land T(e,\\vec x,y)\n\\right\\}\\right)\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Proof\">[Proof]</h2>\n<p>存在见证取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"42029390ebbb59c5\" href=\"?note=42029390ebbb59c5\" title=\"90-lem-program-numbering\">90-lem-program-numbering</a> 的具体 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_k,U\">\\(T_k,U\\)</span>，正向为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"19a3e9309cfd35f0\" href=\"?note=19a3e9309cfd35f0\" title=\"90-df-kleene-normal-form\">90-df-kleene-normal-form</a>。反向逐个判定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(e,\\vec x,0),T(e,\\vec x,1),\\ldots\">\\(T(e,\\vec x,0),T(e,\\vec x,1),\\ldots\\)</span>，找到首个真例后计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span>；未找到则运行不终止。这给出所要求部分函数的机器计算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留双向的存在性正规形陈述，区别于对任意给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,U\">\\(T,U\\)</span> 作断言。此处 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 是关系变量，不是句子理论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-normal-form-theorem-—-Normal-Form-Theorem-(Kleene)","text":"df-normal-form-theorem — Normal Form Theorem (Kleene)","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Proof","text":"[Proof]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-t-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"48b1cea94ba27d41","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-t-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"abc082683aa1de80","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-primitive-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-recursive-function-class","status":"resolved","id":"137d75d038de4a47","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-recursive-function-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-min-operator-generalized","status":"resolved","id":"523fadf1703582fe","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-min-operator-generalized]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading"